    "body": "> which means any GPR could be the target of the swap.\r\n\r\nIt is only the mnemonic that carries the registers explicitly. The encoding only allows targeting sp.\r\n\r\nAlso, this extension alone does not introduce any stack pointer swapping on trap or ret. This is only introduced with Smip.",
